# Frontend bundles: `web/dist` from `pnpm build` (dev) and
# `server/frontend/dist` from `pnpm release` (CI/release). The
# latter is embedded into the riff binary at compile time by
# server/frontend/embed.go's `//go:embed all:dist` directive.
# CI downloads the release artifact into server/frontend/dist
# before `go build` runs; local developers must run
# `cd web && pnpm release` before `go run .`.
dist/

